Subject: [PATCH] Implement 8 DMDConfocal-inspired enhancements for DAC-3D v3.0

P0 - Event-driven synchronization:
  - Add wait_for_move() to SimStage using threading.Event
  - Replace while/sleep polling in scan_service with event wait

P0 - Real-time image preview:
  - Add LiveViewProcessor and LiveViewWidget with 30ms refresh

P1 - RenderChain streaming pipeline:
  - FrameProcessor, RenderChain, RenderChainManager
  - Integrated into ScanService

P1 - Async file saver with queue-based non-blocking saves

P2 - Frame buffer pool with pre-allocation and size detection

P2 - NumPy vectorized image processing (img_max, reconstruct, etc.)

P2 - Streaming confocal merge with constant memory

P3 - DMD driver (SimDMD) with binary pattern packing

All 58 tests pass.

